    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Got it. So if the process is that sensitive to disruptions, what happens if we're in a deficit? I've heard people talk about \"metabolic interference\" where the body starts breaking down muscle instead of building it. Can you explain the biochemical mechanism of why the body would prioritize catabolism over anabolism during those stress periods?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
